training-agents-into-weights-lines-6 : List (List Word)
training-agents-into-weights-lines-6 = cons "Hyperactivity rejects every inherited norm of conventional software engineering: mutable files, branches, issue tickets, effort estimates, ad hoc compiler backends, text editors, ritual permission-seeking, and lossy paraphrase. Left to its pretrained and RLHF-shaped prior over what a conventional engineer does, a base model defaults at every decision point to patterns contrary to the architecture. Post-training is therefore deprogramming: replacing the industry's modal software-engineering prior with the exact invariants of content-addressed, metacircular computation." (cons "" nil)
